'' A header that is not there: TKO0120, clang's own line under 'clang:', and the note
'' that says where a named header is looked for -- not the target's system-header hint,
'' which is for a header the named one included.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -cimport tests/cimport/src/no-such-header.h -cimport-out -
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: error TKO0120: unable to import C header tests/cimport/src/no-such-header.h
'' EXPECT-OUT: note: clang: tiko-cimport.c:1:10: fatal error: 'tests/cimport/src/no-such-header.h' file not found
'' EXPECT-OUT: note: a header is found by the path given, then in each -cinclude directory
'' EXPECT-NOT: note: note:
'' EXPECT-NOT: -csysroot
